      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Controls:\n\t- Use WASD to control the characters Forward, Left, \n\t 
        Backward, and Right movement respectfully\n\t- Use Spacebar to Jump\n\t-
        Use CTRL to Slide\n\t- Use F to Dash\n\t- Left Mouse Button to Shoot\n\t-
        Approach a wall and hold towards it to Climb or Wallrun\nGameplay:\n\t- Fight
        off waves of enemies and delve deeper into your \n      own dream state.
        Beat the final level to wake up.\n\t"
